  "name": "菲米尼",
  "desc": "<p><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255)\">潛懷遐夢 · 菲米尼</span></p><p>繁星麗天，孤懷寒芒。</p>",
  "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2024/09/01/125391187/27ae9488713507608da8d4325ead1777_7467334897063844562.png",
